.TH DOCKER-RECLAIM 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
docker-reclaim \- (no flag)   Dry run — show what would be reclaimed (safe)
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBdocker-reclaim --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: docker-reclaim [-f]

  (no flag)   Dry run — show what would be reclaimed (safe)
  -f          Execute — DESTRUCTIVE: prunes containers, images, volumes,
              build cache, then runs fstrim inside the Colima VM.
              Without fstrim, freed VM space does not return to the macOS host.

  -h, --help  Show this help
.fi
